#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Informazioni sul logging di IBM Quantum su IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Logging per IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Logging per IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "I servizi IBM Cloud&reg;, come IBM Quantum Compute Service, generano log di piattaforma che puoi usare per analizzare attività anomale e azioni critiche nel tuo account, e per risolvere eventuali problemi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Puoi utilizzare [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) un servizio di piattaforma, per instradare i log di piattaforma del tuo account verso una destinazione a tua scelta, configurando un tenant che definisce dove vengono inviati i log. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta [Informazioni su Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Puoi usare [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) per visualizzare i log di piattaforma generati nel tuo account e instradati da IBM Cloud Logs Routing verso un'istanza IBM Cloud Logs, nonché per configurare avvisi su di essi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Posizioni in cui vengono generati i log di piattaforma {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Container Registry genera log di piattaforma visualizzati nelle tue istanze di logging. La tabella seguente elenca le posizioni in cui è abilitata la raccolta automatica dei log del servizio Container Registry.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Posizione                     | Log dei servizi di piattaforma disponibili? |\n"
"|-------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east)   |                    Sì                       |\n"
"| Francoforte (eu-de)           |                    Sì                       |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Log di piattaforma generati {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service genera log dei servizi di piattaforma visualizzati nelle tue istanze di logging nei seguenti casi specifici:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Quando lo stato di un job cambia.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Visualizzare i log dalla pagina Observability {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Per informazioni su come avviare l'interfaccia IBM Cloud Logs, consulta **Launching the UI** nella [documentazione di IBM Cloud Logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Campi per tipo di log {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Per informazioni sui campi inclusi in ogni log di piattaforma, consulta [Campi inclusi nei log di piattaforma.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "I seguenti campi sono inclusi nel record di log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Campo           | Tipo       | Descrizione                                                                           |\n"
"|-----------------|------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Obbligatorio | Definisce l'account e l'istanza di flow log in cui il log viene pubblicato.          |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Obbligatorio | Definisce se IBM salva una copia del record per scopi operativi.                     |\n"
"| message         | Obbligatorio | Descrizione del log generato.                                                        |\n"
